{"4417410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rush B: Esports Manager", "steam_appid": 4417410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a fps esports team and lead them from underdogs to world champions. Scout talent, develop players, manage personalities, and adapt your strategy in a deep, realism-driven management sim. Are you ready to break records and leave your mark on the esports world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/ea1a6c2b57dffcbb97e8bb5484a51c5d.avif?t=1787492995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras_big/ea1a6c2b57dffcbb97e8bb5484a51c5d.webp?t=1787492995 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/466c875cab9e139f6e91e5f6bbac3cc7.poster.avif?t=1787492995\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/466c875cab9e139f6e91e5f6bbac3cc7.webm?t=1787492995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/466c875cab9e139f6e91e5f6bbac3cc7.mp4?t=1787492995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command with our tactical 2D radar view, where every split-second decision can decide the round. Players react based on their attributes, personality, morale, and pressure, creating clutch heroes, costly mistakes, and matches that never play out the same way twice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-match analytics reveal tactical efficiency, economy management, map control, and individual performance trends. Refine your strategies, develop your players, and outsmart the competition on your way to the top of the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/29e91815107b79bbd259ac785b74cf04.avif?t=1787492995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras_big/29e91815107b79bbd259ac785b74cf04.webp?t=1787492995 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/9f49918f15501fd202c2f8d625f78840.poster.avif?t=1787492995\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/9f49918f15501fd202c2f8d625f78840.webm?t=1787492995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/9f49918f15501fd202c2f8d625f78840.mp4?t=1787492995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player is unique. With 24 different attributes and 20 personality modifiers, no two players feel the same. Some look like stars but crumble under pressure, while others rise and thrive in the biggest moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout talent, manage contracts, and balance roster chemistry to forge the perfect team. Every signing or trade shapes your path. Will you nurture rookies into champions or rely on seasoned legends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/89d6e441e3fa538dab646a922970d626.avif?t=1787492995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras_big/89d6e441e3fa538dab646a922970d626.webp?t=1787492995 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/cc690f95c2bd98742be782e9134cd848.poster.avif?t=1787492995\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/cc690f95c2bd98742be782e9134cd848.webm?t=1787492995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/cc690f95c2bd98742be782e9134cd848.mp4?t=1787492995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and develop your roster with individualized plans and role specializations. Guide young prospects into stars, manage egos, and balance team chemistry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morale directly affects performance: players react to match results, team atmosphere, and public praise or criticism. A demoralized star can crumble, while a confident roster becomes unstoppable. Make tough calls on rebuilding, extending veterans, or investing in new talent and shape your club’s legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/3b0da1ec83b383b2b2489e68d7791036.avif?t=1787492995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras_big/3b0da1ec83b383b2b2489e68d7791036.webp?t=1787492995 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/82d029e0d066ed8ac798583d5e0d16db.poster.avif?t=1787492995\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/82d029e0d066ed8ac798583d5e0d16db.webm?t=1787492995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/82d029e0d066ed8ac798583d5e0d16db.mp4?t=1787492995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush B puts real analytics and scouting at the heart of management, giving you the insight to find talent, understand your team, and make smarter decisions. Track player performance, utility efficiency, economy, clutch impact, and map control while analyzing trends across seasons, tournaments, and entire careers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout rising prospects, compare players, plan transfers, and develop talent using the same data that shapes your tactics and roster decisions. Chase records, build your club’s history, and create a lasting legacy where every stat tells a story and every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/c211ff02142f6ff037e297610fec1349.avif?t=1787492995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras_big/c211ff02142f6ff037e297610fec1349.webp?t=1787492995 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/a1422b8f23b3b600c904b32cad6d2fe4.poster.avif?t=1787492995\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/a1422b8f23b3b600c904b32cad6d2fe4.webm?t=1787492995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/a1422b8f23b3b600c904b32cad6d2fe4.mp4?t=1787492995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything leads to match day. Prepare your veto, trust your tactics, and send your team onto the server. Watch every round unfold, endure the pressure of the clutch, and see if all your preparation was enough to secure the victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is another step toward trophies, records, and your place at the top of the esports world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/8eb0808647752ccadb49c3085229d3bf.poster.avif?t=1787492995\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/8eb0808647752ccadb49c3085229d3bf.webm?t=1787492995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/8eb0808647752ccadb49c3085229d3bf.mp4?t=1787492995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a fps esports team and lead them from underdogs to world champions. Scout talent, develop players, manage personalities, and adapt your strategy in a deep, realism-driven management sim. Are you ready to break records and leave your mark on the esports world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras/ea1a6c2b57dffcbb97e8bb5484a51c5d.avif?t=1787492995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417410/extras_big/ea1a6c2b57dffcbb97e8bb5484a51c5d.webp?t=1787492995 width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ct